WEBVTT

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:50.000
An Inn, a Tower, a Bear, and a Banquet

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:53.670
Miss! Miss!

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:00.020
Miss, it's already morning.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:07.920
Huh?

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.190
Good morning!

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.180
Oh... good morning.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.910
My body is...

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:24.210
moving?!

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.000
Are you all right, miss?

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.430
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:30.520
Are you sure?

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.030
Yup. Positive.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:33.430
Here.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:34.870
I can have it?

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:36.840
Thank you!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.390
You're very welcome.

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.900
It's time for breakfast, so hurry down!

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.270
Huh? An item box?

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:48.660
Could this mean...

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:51.190
Ow!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.920
This is... the high elf...

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:03.570
It's the avatar I created in Leadale.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:06.050
Does that mean I'm inside the ga—

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:12.760
Guess you can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:21.430
Come on, now. Have a seat, missy.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.080
Your soup's going to get cold.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.680
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:30.040
Here you go, miss.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.360
Thanks.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.820
It smells so good.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:41.490
I can't remember the last time
I actually ate food with my mouth.

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:51.840
It's so good!

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:56.240
Well, you sure know how to
make someone smile.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.600
What kind of food have you
been eating up until now?

00:03:58.600 --> 00:03:59.840
Well...

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:05.270
Pills, liquids, and IV drips... so, yeah.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.080
Huh?

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.590
Oh, nothing!

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:11.740
You're wasting half your life
if you're not eating well.

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:12.860
Here!

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:15.780
It's on the house!
Eat as much as you'd like!

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:18.540
Th-Thank you very much.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.860
I wonder if I can eat all of this.

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.410
But it looks so good!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.770
Thank you for the food.

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.930
You're very welcome.

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:35.180
This place seems familiar.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.800
Let's see...

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.920
This is the inn in the village
that's on the border

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:43.010
of the White Kingdom of Felstes and
the Green Kingdom of Gruskeilo, right?

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:47.280
Wait, but this village is
supposed to be prosperous,

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:49.070
since it's along a trading route.

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:50.440
And yet...

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.590
Is something the matter?

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:59.440
I remember this place being far
livelier the last time I was here.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:04.450
Livelier? That'd have to
be about 200 years ago.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:05.590
Two hundred years?

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:08.000
Things have gone downhill since

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.580
the Kingdom of Felskeilo was established.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.990
Felskeilo?

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.570
What's with that name?
It sounds like someone merged

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.420
the White Kingdom and the
Green Kingdom together!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.760
I'm not inside the Leadale
that I actually played in?

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:23.920
Oh? You don't know about Felskeilo?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.650
N-No... I was away for a while.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:32.100
Long ago, the seven nations
were constantly fighting,

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:34.880
and everywhere was in shambles.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:38.460
Then, because the fighting got so bad,

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:41.420
God chose leaders among the people.

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:44.940
Those leaders worked hard to scale the
number of kingdoms down to three,

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.520
and that brings us to today.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:49.330
I had no idea.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:54.610
The seven kingdoms were how
the world was laid out in Leadale.

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:59.380
Am I actually in that world,
but 200 years after I played it?

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:02.900
You really came here that long ago?

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.300
Y-Yes... Though it was only once.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:09.220
I guess elves really do live long lives!

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:13.760
I'm Marelle. This little one is Lytt.

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.310
Hi, my name is Lytt.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.820
My name is Cayna.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.320
Oh, um...

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:23.070
I'd like to stay at this inn for a while.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.860
Would this be enough?

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.120
Oh, my goodness!

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:30.410
Don't go flaunting all this money like that!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.450
Huh? All this money?

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.910
Four coins is enough to
spend ten nights at this inn.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.840
Huh? R-Really?

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:41.920
I guess the value of money has
changed a lot in 200 years.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.140
W-Well, here you go, then.

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:47.450
I'll be in your care for a while.

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:49.430
Sure thing. Payment received.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:52.740
Make yourself right at home.

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.990
No need to hold back.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.320
Not at all.

00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:01.030
Well, then...

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:05.150
Name: Cayna. Level 1100.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.780
Race: high elf.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:09.890
Title: Skill Master No. 03.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:11.380
I guess nothing's changed.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.830
And my status... Yeah, I'm strong.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:18.700
I know I'm talking about myself here,
but I'm way too OP.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.380
As for items...

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.670
Oh, right. Kee, are you around?

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.930
Yes. I am right here.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.800
My job is to support you, after all.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.590
There are two urgent matters
that require your attention.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:32.640
Urgent?

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:36.690
First, you have been cut off
from the hospital's system.

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:41.300
Second, you've been disconnected
from Leadale's master system.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:44.360
I've been cut off from the hospital's system?

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:46.060
What happened?

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:49.700
I speculate that a power outage
happened after you went to bed.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.620
A power outage...

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:02.590
And probably due to
that power outage, I'm...

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:07.560
My mind somehow escaped into the game,
but my physical body is...

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:16.360
Crap...

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:21.860
Wait, it's nighttime?!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.610
There should be other players
besides me on this continent, right?

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.660
I wonder how they're all doing.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:35.330
First, I'll have to find my tower
and gather some information.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:38.500
I wonder if I can still do it.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.320
Magic Skill: Light.

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:45.250
Level 1: Ready Set.

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:51.490
Lytt? What's the matter?

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.200
U-Um... Is that hurting you?

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.500
I'm fine. It's just a harmless light.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.950
Is this the first time
you've seen magic, Lytt?

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:07.030
I guess it might be rare for normal
villagers to even see magic.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:10.930
I see. You were coming up
here to bring me a light.

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:14.200
No, it's okay. This is much brighter.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.240
You're amazing, miss.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:21.870
Oh, hey.

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.040
It's time for dinner.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.440
Oh... H-Hello.

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:41.980
Sorry it's so noisy in here.

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:46.520
They're all basically harmless,
though, so don't you worry.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.120
Hey, that's mean.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.280
Yeah!

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:51.430
Be careful, missy.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:54.820
She may not look it, but she
used to be this village's best figh—

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.350
Keep your mouth shut.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:58.090
Go on. Eat up while it's still warm.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:00.200
Oh, sure. Thank you.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.000
Huh?

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:04.570
I'm Luine, Marelle's oldest daughter.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.540
I come by at night to help out.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.340
You're Cayna, right?

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:09.780
Um... yes.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:13.800
Come on, Luine. The food's getting cold.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:18.150
If you've got time to chat,
start serving them drinks.

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:20.560
Yeah, yeah. Jeez, Mom...

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:27.480
So good.

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:34.200
What are you doing in a remote
place like this anyway, Cayna?

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:37.720
Um... well...

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:39.000
I'm looking for something.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.170
Looking for something?

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:41.370
Like what?

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:47.290
My home tower... It's this silver tower.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:50.850
Y-You're going somewhere that terrifying?

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.520
D-Don't do it!

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:53.420
H-Huh?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.300
You know about the tower?

00:10:56.300 --> 00:11:01.010
There's a legend saying the terrifying
Silver Ring Witch lives there!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:05.490
Are you okay, miss?

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.740
I'm fine! I'm perfectly healthy!
No problems at all!

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:10.640
I'll be going to bed now! Goodnight!

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:14.590
I wonder what's wrong.

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:20.120
It's been 200 years, and yet...

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:24.590
My stupid "Silver Ring Witch"
nickname is still around!

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:27.040
It's so insanely embarrassing.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.000
My dark past where I stomped
on so many other players...

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.130
Oh, wait.

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:37.090
If my dark past is still around,
that just proves there are other players.

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:39.550
Okay, I'll try getting to the tower tomorrow.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:45.390
Widdle Cayna is 317 years owd!

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.650
Shh! What if she wakes up?

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.030
S-Sorry.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:07.420
Come on, hurry up.
A traveling elf should be loaded.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:08.420
Right.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:26.390
Pervert Blocker: Summoning Magic:
Lightning Spirit has been activated.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.820
Bro, let go of me!

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:32.610
Just shut up and run!

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:42.660
Report deemed unnecessary.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.450
Deleted from log.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.450
Wow, it's such a nice day!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.340
Eagle Eyes.

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:01.550
There it is!

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.560
Are you really going to go so lightly dressed?

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:12.960
You're not thinking of going to the tower
where the Silver Ring Witch is, are you?

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.640
Of course not.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.200
I'm just going to search
for some medicinal herbs.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:22.170
I know you're an elf, but I'm still worried.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.700
There are monsters in that forest, too.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:28.820
I'm pretty strong, despite
how I look. Have no fear.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:30.200
You sure?

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:33.240
All right, well... Be careful.

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:36.920
Miss, at least take this with you.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:39.430
Thank you, Lytt.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:43.970
I'll try to find a little gift for you,
so look forward to it.

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:44.890
Okay!

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:57.940
Okay, no one's around, so...

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:00.470
Guardian Ring.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:05.660
Now I should be able to get to my tower base.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:07.580
One who protects in times of trouble!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:12.380
I beseech you to rescue this
depraved world from chaos!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.500
I swear, they went way too
overboard on these effects.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:33.640
Good grief!

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.630
Looks I made it in just fine.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:39.320
Couldn't they have done something
about the dumb password, though?

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:55.070
Hey, hey, hey!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.750
It's been a while, Master!

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:02.600
You left me, the Guardian of the
Silver Tower, alone for 200 years!

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:05.030
Where the hell have you been?

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:11.140
Did you always speak so rudely?

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.380
Wha?

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:14.890
What, are you a delinquent now?

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:19.440
Has anyone passed the tower's
trials while I've been gone?

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:20.930
Nope!

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:23.520
It's so damn peaceful, I could puke.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.110
Oh, yeah.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:29.160
Skargo came by about 60 years ago.

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:32.350
He was trying to get in touch with you.

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:37.990
And you had the nerve to ignore
my call then, didn't ya? Huh?!

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:41.540
Well, my hands were kinda full.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.130
Forget 60 years.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:46.700
I'm not even sure I was in this
world for the last 200 years.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:46.700
Hey? Hello? You listening?

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:51.140
Skargo came by. Didn't you hear me?

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:53.710
I heard you, but who's that?

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:58.130
Guess you've finally
gone senile, you old hag.

00:15:58.130 --> 00:15:59.020
Oh?

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.940
Say that again?

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.270
I was wrong!

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:10.400
Please forgive me, Master!

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:12.190
Well, whatever.

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:14.950
Anyway, who's Skargo again?

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:18.080
He's your son, remember?

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:20.460
What?! My son?!

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:22.980
A son? I couldn't possibly...

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:25.070
Hm? Skargo?

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:27.170
Yeah, you've lost it.

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:27.880
Skargo... Son...

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:28.760
Oh.

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:33.010
Oh, right! The Foster System!

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:36.010
The Foster System? The heck is that?

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:39.480
Oh, um... Simply put...

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:44.120
I could make NPCs by spending
real money in the game.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.170
Huh?

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:49.030
Talk about a convenient way
to make in-game money.

00:16:49.030 --> 00:16:50.770
Anyway, enough about that.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:53.780
I see. Skargo... My son.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.790
Not only do I have a son,

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:57.910
I even created a sister and
a little brother for him.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:00.540
I wonder how they're all doing.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:04.330
I never got to date anyone,
so I never got married.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:08.340
And yet, I have three children,
all over 200 years old.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:11.470
Would you stop talking nonsense already?

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:32.040
I guess this part is the same as the game.

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.410
Let's see... What should I take with me?

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:35.830
Say, Master.

00:17:36.170 --> 00:17:39.110
You didn't just come here
to grab some items, did you?

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:41.500
Actually, yeah. That's the
main reason I'm here.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:45.380
I'm also looking for some information.
Anything strange happen lately?

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:51.460
Skargo said something about the seven
kingdoms uniting into three or something.

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.010
Yeah, I heard about that.

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:57.380
I wonder what happened to the
other players besides me.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:59.220
Hell if I know.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:03.690
Half of your crew were humans,
so they're probably six feet under.

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:05.860
Probably, yeah...

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:08.270
All right, that should do it.

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:09.790
And...

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.190
Wh-What?

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.780
I'll give you some MP.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.360
There we go.

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.900
You were running on empty, weren't you?

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.080
Damn right I was.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:26.080
You left me hanging for 200 years!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.000
Right...

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:30.170
Now you'll be able to watch
over this tower for a while again.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.990
Uh, say, Master...

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:36.210
I've got a little request.

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:37.050
What?

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:42.020
I guess the other Guardian
Towers stopped functioning.

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:44.140
Could you go check on them
if you get a chance?

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:46.810
I guess they've been ignored, too.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.820
All right. I'll go look for them.

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:52.750
I'm counting on you, Master.

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:57.670
Well, I guess I'll head back to the village.

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:58.810
Oh, shoot!

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:02.570
I should've left something in the village
so I could set it as my teleport destination.

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:05.670
Damn it... Guess I'll have to run.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:15.110
Travel Speed Up, Agility Up,
Movement Up... selected.

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:17.220
Okay.

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.980
I can't remember the last time I exercised.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:34.750
I know I used magic, but running at
full speed is... j-j-just rough.

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:39.120
It came from the road.

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:41.780
Is someone being attacked?

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:47.290
A horned bear?

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:58.510
You okay?

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.350
Y-Yeah...

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:02.260
You're pretty amazing, missy.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:06.050
Um, yeah... Just because
of my active skills.

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:06.610
Huh?

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:08.060
Er, never mind.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:12.720
Ten... no, even twenty bears
would be no match for me!

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:17.840
Thanks. I hope I can repay you somehow.

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:19.060
No worries.

00:20:19.060 --> 00:20:22.610
It's only natural to help someone
out when they're in trouble.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.010
But, missy...

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:26.500
If you really want to thank me...

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.690
My name is Cayna.

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:32.420
I'd appreciate it if you called me
that instead of "missy."

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:35.570
My name's Lottor.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:38.090
Thanks again, Cayna.

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:40.580
Sure. I'm glad you're okay.

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:47.850
You must be really strong, miss!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:50.650
A horned bear sure is some gift!

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:51.850
Tell me about it.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.000
You went into the woods
for medicinal herbs

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.410
and came back with a whole horned bear.

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:57.990
Talk about a surprise.

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.860
Well, because of that,

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:03.010
we get to partake in the spoils.

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:05.430
Thanks, Cayna!

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:06.740
Thanks!

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:09.660
Here, Cayna.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:10.610
What's this?

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:12.060
It's wine.

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.390
Wow... It smells sweet.

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.130
You've never had it before?

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:19.980
Even though you've been
alive for over 200 years?

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:22.300
I didn't really have many
opportunities to drink.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.060
In actuality, I haven't
been alive for centuries.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:27.600
And I was confined to a hospital bed, so...

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:30.490
Well, let's have a toast.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:35.580
Cayna, you're the star tonight,
so you get to lead us in this toast.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:36.770
Right...

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:39.940
To new encounters!

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:41.360
To new encounters!

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:45.070
It's so good.

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:49.450
Look at you go, miss.

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:53.240
Huh?

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.580
Oh, Cayna...

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:03.590
She may be tough against horned bears,
but she's no match for alcohol.

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:05.300
Goodnight, miss.

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:07.670
Sweet dreams.
